so in this level i had to search for a password hidden in the home directory inside a file on home page 

Process
1.First i did ls command and found a file named readme.
2. Then i opened the file using cat command and found the password in it.
3. then i exited the bandit0 user login .
4. then i logined into bandit1 user using the following command
    ssh bandit1@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
